      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm not sure I follow. Why are you using metaphors like \"mischievous goblins\" and \"goblins of the skin\"? Can we please just stick to the clinical coding guidance? I need to know how to differentiate between L85.9 and other keratinization disorders specifically when the lesion morphology is highly irregular. What are the actual clinical indicators that should drive the code selection in these cases?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
